<title>USA: Dove Entertainment Inc 1996 shr loss $1.31.</title>
<headline>Dove Entertainment Inc 1996 shr loss $1.31.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	     1995</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p>   Publishing, net		11,586     10,961</p>
<p>   Film and television	  15,267	  187</p>
